{{!
    @template local_jedomi/admin/position_preview

    Live preview of the floating button in the Personalization tab: a small page where the button sits in the chosen
    corner and the panel side is marked. The button can be dragged, or moved with the arrow keys, to set its distances.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="local_jedomi/personalization/preview" - The preview page, read by local_jedomi/admin/personalization
    * data-region="local_jedomi/personalization/button" - The button in the preview, moved by the module
    * data-region="local_jedomi/personalization/panel" - The panel side in the preview
    * data-customavatar - Whether a custom avatar is set: then the preset avatar choice does not change the preview

    Context variables required for this template:
    * avatarurl string - Address of the avatar shown on the button; empty for the Jedomi icon
    * icon object - {"trigger": true}: the Jedomi icon, shown while there is no avatar image
    * customavatar bool - Whether a custom avatar is set
    * name string - Name of the assistant, as the text alternative of the button
    * help string - How to move the button in the preview

    Example context (json):
    {
        "avatarurl": "https://example.com/local/jedomi/pix/avatars/avatar_01.png",
        "icon": {"trigger": true},
        "customavatar": false,
        "name": "Jedomi",
        "help": "Drag the button in the preview."
    }
}}
<div class="local_jedomi-position-preview" data-region="local_jedomi/personalization/preview"
    data-customavatar="{{#customavatar}}1{{/customavatar}}{{^customavatar}}0{{/customavatar}}">
    <div class="local_jedomi-position-preview-panel" data-region="local_jedomi/personalization/panel" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <button type="button" class="local_jedomi-position-preview-button" data-region="local_jedomi/personalization/button"
        aria-label="{{name}}" aria-describedby="local_jedomi-position-preview-help">
        <img src="{{avatarurl}}" alt="" class="{{^avatarurl}}d-none{{/avatarurl}}">
        <span class="local_jedomi-position-preview-icon {{#avatarurl}}d-none{{/avatarurl}}">{{> local_jedomi/local/sidebar/icon }}</span>
    </button>
</div>
<p id="local_jedomi-position-preview-help" class="form-text text-muted">{{help}}</p>
{{#js}}
require(['local_jedomi/admin/personalization'], function(personalization) {
    personalization.init();
});
{{/js}}
